  "description": "Open-source SAML 2.0 / SAML-P support for .NET and ASP.NET applications acting as an Identity Provider (IdP), Service Provider (SP), or Relying Party (RP). Supports login, logout, metadata, RSA and ECDSA signing, validation allowlists, configurable AES-CBC/AES-GCM assertion encryption, RSA key encryption, decryption, Redirect, POST, and Artifact bindings, Azure Key Vault certificate scenarios, and tested interoperability with Microsoft Entra ID, AD FS, Azure AD B2C, NemLog-in/OIOSAML, and other SAML 2.0 solutions. The README explains when to implement SAML 2.0 directly with the package and when FoxIDs can act as an external SAML 2.0 bridge for applications that already support OpenID Connect or WS-Federation.",
